.Dd November 17, 2026
.Dt BATCH 1
.Os RavenBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm batch
.Nd queue a command for the idle at queue
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Ar command ...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Nm
utility queues one command line on the idle queue.
It is equivalent to
.Nm at
with an immediate due time and the batch flag set.
The command is read from standard input on
the host; the target accepts command words.
.Pp
The
.Nm atd
daemon runs batch jobs on a scheduler tick with no due regular job.
There is no load-average
source, so an idle tick is the low-load proxy.
.Sh ENVIRONMENT
.Bl -tag -width AT_SPOOL
.It Ev AT_SPOOL
Override the spool directory.
Used by the host tests.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
0 on success, 1 for a validation or spool error, 2 for usage.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr at 1 ,
.Xr atd 1
.Sh STANDARDS
The queueing subset of POSIX
.Nm batch .
Multi-line scripts and shell metacharacters are unsupported.
